WEBVTT

00:01:25.112 --> 00:01:31.010
A, B, C, D, E, F, G,

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:34.040
H, I, J, K.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.562
Trepnuo je na K.

00:01:38.092 --> 00:01:40.246
Krenula sam ispočetka.

00:01:40.246 --> 00:01:44.740
A, B, C, D, E, F, G,

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:46.030
H, I.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:49.888
Tada ja trepnuo na slovo I,

00:01:49.888 --> 00:01:53.880
zatim na T, pa R i na kraju na A:

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.727
Kitra.

00:01:55.727 --> 00:01:59.685
Rekao je: "Kitra, draga moja, 
nemoj plakati.

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:02.470
Ovo je blagoslov."